msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Won't you just try this cup of ramen and tell me what you\r\n"
"think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Looks like you got that old ramen shop owner pretty riled up\r\n"
"back there. Is everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Ah, yeah... Everything's fine. It wasn't like we were fighting or anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Weren't you arguing over the flavor for something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Aye... That we were..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Hmm. Are you trying to get him to share the business with you? Is that what "
"it is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "(What is up with this guy...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "(...And why is he staring at me like that?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Hey, if there's something you want to say, then just spit it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Oh, well, it's just... You look like a guy who loves his ramen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Well... I suppose I do enjoy a good bowl of ramen sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Then I hafta ask you a favor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "...Such as?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"I need ya to slurp down this cup of instant ramen for me. If ya do please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "...You want me to do what now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Oh geez, I didn't even introduce myself. The name's Ueda, I work in product "
"development for Acecook. Ever heard of it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Acecook? You mean the instant noodle company?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"That's right! As you may know, we specialize in making only\r\n"
"the best instant ramen on the market!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"One day I fell in love with the delicious tonkotsu ramen at this here shop, "
"so I started commuting here from Osaka to try and replicate it. Or at least "
"an instant version of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "I see. That's quite the undertaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Ain't that the truth? I mean, this is the seventh time I had\r\n"
"to alter the flavor, yet the owner still won't approve it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Seven times and still no luck? Maybe you're in the wrong business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Hey, ya don't have to kick me when I'm down... Anyway, would ya mind givin' "
"it a taste and tellin' me what ya think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "No... I think I'll pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Oh, okay... Not even worth trying, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"In the end... I guess this broth still isn't good enough to\r\n"
"to wear the Kyushu No. 1 Star logo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I guess I could give it a try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Yeah... It's not quite like the real thing.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Well, whaddya think? I'm pretty confident about this batch\r\n"
"myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Well, when I tried it, there was something off about the broth. It lacked "
"the rich, distinctive flavor that the ramen at the shop has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"That's what the owner said, too... Which means this broth still ain't good "
"enough to wear the Kyushu No. 1 Star logo after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "But what else can I do? I tried everything already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"And the owner says I have to think about the flavor on my\r\n"
"own, too... It's like I'm at the end of my rope here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"If all you can do is whine about it, then you might as well\r\n"
"give up. Be happy with the fact you made the best instant\r\n"
"ramen you could, and leave it at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"What're ya sayin'!? Don't ya realize how obsessed I am with\r\n"
"the incredible taste that only Kyushu No. 1 Star delivers!?\r\n"
"I ain't gonna quit just 'cause some rando tells me to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Are you sure you've tried everything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"You are trying to recreate Kyushu No. 1 Star's ramen down to the last "
"detail, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "You bet your sweet bippy I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"Well, that's not what you should be doing. Instead, you\r\n"
"should be aiming for an instant version of their ramen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "How... is that not what I'm already doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm no ramen expert, but I imagine that restaurant-made ramen and "
"instant noodles have very different methods of preparation. Not to mention "
"ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"I'll bet the owner knows that already, and that's why he\r\n"
"won't give you a recipe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Come again?"
msgstr "Come scusa?"

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"If he tells you the recipe, you'll be so influenced by it\r\n"
"that you won't be able to condense it into its proper form."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"I think the owner wants you to create your own original\r\n"
"instant ramen that replicates the Kyushu No. 1 Star taste,\r\n"
"rather than copying it down to the last ingredient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Otherwise, he would've turned you down flat instead of\r\n"
"bothering to let you try... what was it, seven times?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Now that I think about it, the owner never once told me <Italic>not</Italic>\r\n"
"to make it into instant ramen... He just kept tellin' me to\r\n"
"try over and over again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Alright, then, I won't give up! My love for that irresistible\r\n"
"Kyushu No. 1 Star flavor's been redoubled, and I'll stop at\r\n"
"nothing to meet the owner's expectations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "But... where do I go from here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"Well, you're gonna have to find a way to make a cup of instant noodles taste"
" authentic. And that's no easy task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"Right. It's gotta have that kinda flavor that kicks ya in the teeth and "
"makes ya come back beggin' for more! Shocks ya at the first sip, and has ya "
"addicted by the second! Wooh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Now what I need to do first is figure out the magic ingredient..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"By the way, you give some real good advice, ya know! I'll let this stew in "
"my head for a while and see what I can whip up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid ""
"Sorry about that, sir. You don't have to put up with any of this nonsense if"
" you don't want to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "...Were you watching this whole time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"Shoot, when people talk loudly enough out in front of the shop, I hear it "
"whether I like it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Heh. Then I guess we'll both see whether that Ueda kid can pull it off or "
"not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"Right... At first, I was offended at the idea of my ramen\r\n"
"going instant, but something about his motivation really\r\n"
"stuck with me. The kid's got spunk, I'll tell you that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "So that's why you won't compromise until he gets it right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"Mm. I know he can make a soup that'll satisfy the masses.\r\n"
"I believe it's all a matter of time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"And since it's like fate at work here, could I bother you to help him out if"
" you run into him again? Consider it a favor for an old man."
msgstr ""

